uto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=892692e7ea6998aadf0ac78addab1d4b, https://si.imgix.net/7a77e4f9/uploads/origins/caf49eb1-5c71-440f-9bd6-b5cb9459a7c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71c08892fc8fea435f86a1d62ddce6a1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7a77e4f9/uploads/origins/caf49eb1-5c71-440f-9bd6-b5cb9459a7c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b8c5335e1a73b0aeca16b0ace8fd48a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "その人物は肩越しのルックをしており、体はそっぽを向きながら、頭をそっと見る人のほうに振り返っている。\nその表情は柔らかく、穏やかで、少しメランコリックだ。\nシーンは夜、月明かりの下で行われ、背景には明るい月と散らばった星がある。\n柔らかな月明かりが人物の顔と髪を照らし、夢のような、映画のような雰囲気を作り出している。\n全体的なムードは静かで、感情的で、落ち着いている。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1s3GEaVS-UNF-g59ELWxzTF_obbakY3gG/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@06nareki/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac2d5b77/uploads/origins/1e698b8e-3689-41c8-b1c7-c53c8f4c25a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6005a3e7ecc53d3e95c2bf4a1bf53f0f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac2d5b77/uploads/origins/1e698b8e-3689-41c8-b1c7-c53c8f4c25a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6005a3e7ecc53d3e95c2bf4a1bf53f0f, https://si.imgix.net/ac2d5b77/uploads/origins/1e698b8e-3689-41c8-b1c7-c53c8f4c25a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fad8cfd10d393c3c9d94392b24792747 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac2d5b77/uploads/origins/1e698b8e-3689-41c8-b1c7-c53c8f4c25a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d6fcaf074335e7d62c08b96a5e88c41 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n私のチュパカブラのキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？人懐っこくて、のんびりしているけど、ちょっとおっちょこちょい！食べ物と食べることが大好きで、ヤギに夢中です。でも、その動機はたぶん甘くない...。\n\nお好きなように描いてください！ありがとうございました！\n\n参考文献\nhttps://toyhou.se/3693197.chupacabra/gallery#56026011\nhttps://toyhou.se/3693197.chupacabra/gallery#31365069", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@06nareki/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d93a95cb/uploads/origins/41c8f3fd-cbcd-4fba-9fb1-de1397d03342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c66b5da5e36a41b4cef96b797cf73359", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d93a95cb/uploads/origins/41c8f3fd-cbcd-4fba-9fb1-de1397d03342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c66b5da5e36a41b4cef96b797cf73359, https://si.imgix.net/d93a95cb/uploads/origins/41c8f3fd-cbcd-4fba-9fb1-de1397d03342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=103a9ba5f027ac87c9c3b0587f7f3c79 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d93a95cb/uploads/origins/41c8f3fd-cbcd-4fba-9fb1-de1397d03342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=121f235f2dfa065eb9d3e53bd9b4e766 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd like to make a request for my OC!\n\nIt is an alarm clock with the personality of a cat. It is lazy and likes to watch TV and play games. Its head is like an alarm clock, and its body is like an egg timer. When it is startled, it can ring like an alarm clock as well! I haven't finished its design but I would love to have you draw it <3\n\nFeel free to do any pose that you want.\n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GDVRWZfCUoJp4XhjGBhR0vrurQfFjhYn?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@06nareki/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c80f657a/uploads/origins/a3d45bf8-b64f-4311-a26a-2f1de7aef007?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6864933e6a9de1586dc0ae9b23f5403", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c80f657a/uploads/origins/a3d45bf8-b64f-4311-a26a-2f1de7aef007?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6864933e6a9de1586dc0ae9b23f5403, https://si.imgix.net/c80f657a/uploads/origins/a3d45bf8-b64f-4311-a26a-2f1de7aef007?bg=%